{"titel": "The Owl That Turns Its Head Around", "thumbnail": "Its head spins *270°*", "format": "9:16", "musik": true, "outro": true, "stil": "cartoon", "sprache": "en", "stimme": "am_michael", "farben": ["#0b0f1f", "#4338ca", "#facc15"], "stimmung": "spannung", "szenen": [{"typ": "titel", "text": "This bird can look *behind* itself", "kulisse": "nacht", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🦉", "aktion": "zittern", "groesse": "riesig", "wo": "unten"}], "effekt": "blitz", "sound": "boom", "dauer": 1.5, "animation": "pop", "sprecher": "This bird can look straight behind itself."}, {"typ": "text", "text": "Its eyes can't *move*", "kulisse": "nacht", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🦉", "aktion": "zittern", "groesse": "gross", "sagt": "Stuck!"}, {"emoji": "👀", "aktion": "pulsieren", "wo": "oben", "groesse": "klein"}], "dauer": 2, "sprecher": "An owl's huge eyes are locked in place by bone."}, {"typ": "text", "text": "So it turns its *head*", "kulisse": "nacht", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🦉", "aktion": "wackeln", "groesse": "gross"}], "sound": "whoosh", "dauer": 1.8, "sprecher": "So instead, it swivels its whole head."}, {"typ": "zahl", "text": "270°", "unterzeile": "in each direction", "kulisse": "neon", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🦉", "aktion": "wackeln", "groesse": "gross", "sagt": "Wheee!"}], "effekt": "zoom", "sound": "riser", "dauer": 2.2, "sprecher": "Up to two hundred seventy degrees in each direction."}, {"typ": "text", "text": "A mouse sneaks *behind*", "kulisse": "gras", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🐭", "aktion": "rein-rechts", "groesse": "mittel", "sagt": "He can't see me."}, {"emoji": "🦉", "aktion": "still", "wo": "links"}], "dauer": 2, "sprecher": "A mouse thinks it is safe behind the owl."}, {"typ": "text", "text": "*Nope.*", "kulisse": "alarm", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🦉", "aktion": "wackeln", "groesse": "gross", "wo": "links", "sagt": "Hello."}, {"emoji": "🐭", "aktion": "zittern", "wo": "rechts", "groesse": "mittel"}], "comic": "YIKES!", "effekt": "wackeln", "dauer": 1.8, "sprecher": "Wrong. The head just spins around."}, {"typ": "text", "text": "Humans would tear their *arteries*", "kulisse": "alarm", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🧍", "aktion": "umkippen", "groesse": "gross", "sagt": "Ouch!"}], "sound": "boom", "dauer": 2, "sprecher": "If we tried that, we could tear the arteries in our neck."}, {"typ": "text", "text": "Owls have blood *reservoirs*", "unterzeile": "under the jaw", "kulisse": "neon", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🩸", "aktion": "pulsieren", "anzahl": 3, "groesse": "klein"}, {"emoji": "🦉", "aktion": "wachsen", "wo": "links"}], "dauer": 2.2, "sprecher": "Owls have stretchy blood reservoirs that keep the brain supplied."}, {"typ": "text", "text": "And extra room in the *bones*", "kulisse": "nacht", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🦴", "aktion": "wackeln", "groesse": "mittel"}, {"emoji": "🦉", "aktion": "pulsieren", "wo": "links", "groesse": "mittel"}], "dauer": 2, "sprecher": "Plus wide holes in the neck bones, so arteries can twist safely."}, {"typ": "ende", "text": "Never try to *sneak* past one", "unterzeile": "Follow for daily nature facts 🦉", "kulisse": "nacht", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🦉", "aktion": "wackeln", "groesse": "mittel"}], "dauer": 2.4, "sprecher": "So never sneak behind an owl. It can look behind itself."}]}